// Ch7 B01 "Into Tamsule" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch07.md §2 B01). T01: the hired barge comes in
// at the river mouth under the stilt city, gilded signboards in the lower third, the Bell on its
// gantry filling the top half with the drop of seawater hanging still in its mouth. The camera holds
// the Bell 3 s and nobody comments. T02: they tie up. Liss sour, Ysolde dry, and Rhen, looking up at
// the Bell, very quietly, to himself. Then Liss and Ysolde drift off into the market (Ysolde to the
// gantry foot, where her bark waits). The chapter flow moves the story to chapter 7 before this.
// Watch (ADR 0017 Ch7): no Order presence on the river front; the Bell is not commented on.
title: ch07_into_tamsule
location: ch07/tamsule
---
@letterbox on
@camera T01
@music tamsule_port fade=1.0
@wait 3.0
@camera T02
@anim rhen look_at bell_moorings
Liss [cold]: Tidecup week. Every purse-cutter on the coast is here. #line:ch07_into_001
Ysolde [neutral]: Then hold on to yours, Mistress Varrow. #line:ch07_into_002
@wait 0.8
Rhen [tender]: ...Oruvel always came up for this. #line:ch07_into_003
@mark liss drift_liss walk
@mark ysolde drift_ysolde walk
@wait 3.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
